    "I_AI = Σ_k (α_k•attention_scores_k•e^(−β•Δt_k))",
    "m_info = E_AI/c² = (N_MI•I•f)/(t_h_comp•c²)",
    "E_AI = (N_MI•I•f)/t_h_comp",
    "t_h_AI = t_clock / log₂(N_operations)•(1 + |grad_Loss/grad_t|)",
    "X_It_h = I•f•t_h/ШУ³",
    "P^SV = (−1)^N_MI•(I•f)/|I•f|•e^(−α(t)•МЕ_IJ)•m^E",
    "x² + (y − A/2)² = (A/2)²",
